      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "One big plus of this is that people using Virtual Desktop can choose to use something like VirtualDesktop-OpenXR instead of SteamVR if they'd like to, saving on performance and providing a generally more integrated experience/having one less dashboard to have to fight to get into VR:\n\nhttps://github.com/mbucchia/VirtualDesktop-OpenXR/wiki#applications\n\nWould also mean VRC would be able to forego OSC solutions for face/eye tracking and do it natively which is also pretty big.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
