  "details": "OpenXR has been a standard for a few years now allowing for games to be ran without needing to utilize steamVR as a proxy runtime.\n\nThis also allows some openXR plugins to be used in games that support it without conflicting with EAC as it does not have native access to the game allowing things like OpenXR toolkit to function.\n\nI believe this migration would be a great pros for the VRC community with no foreseeable cons minus controller bindings being reset.",
